      "title": "BP seeks to end years of boardroom turmoil with appointment of new chair",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/sep/02/bp-appoints-new-chair-after-ousting-of-albert-manifold-in-may",
      "description": "<p>Ian Tyler, already in role on an interim basis, is tasked with shifting strategy to refocus on fossil fuel extraction</p><p>BP has appointed a new chair after a months-long search triggered by the controversial <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/may/26/bp-chair-albert-manifold-ian-tyler\">ousting of Albert Manifold</a>, seeking to draw a line under years of boardroom turmoil at the UK oil and gas company.</p><p>Ian Tyler, who has served as the interim chair and has sat on the BP board as a non-executive director since April 2025, will assume the role on a permanent basis immediately.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/sep/02/bp-appoints-new-chair-after-ousting-of-albert-manifold-in-may\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-02T14:58:36"
    },
    {
      "title": "BP names interim chairman Ian Tyler as chair with immediate effect",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/companies/people/bp-names-interim-chairman-ian-tyler-as-chair-with-immediate-effect-126090201469_1.html",
      "description": "Tyler, who joined BP's board as a non-executive director in April 2025, has served as interim chairman since May and will take over the role with immediate effect",
